cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this material, please cite it as follows."
title: "Linear Algebra: online lecture notes with a computation lab"
abstract: >-
  The lecture notes of the Linear Algebra course — sums and products, vectors,
  matrices and determinants, elementary operations, inverse matrix, LU
  factorization, eigenvalues, norms and linear systems — with worked examples,
  exercises and an interactive computation lab showing every step.
